I've made a number of changes, and seperated everything that was not
hobbit-related out of this patch.  Changes from last version include:

 * Hobbits now cannot wear armor other than cloaks, shirts, or elven
mithril coats due to size
 * Hobbits (and other small creatures) can traverse diagonal spaces
regardless of load due to their small size (no more "you are carrying
too much to get through").
 * Hobbits (and other small creatures) now cannot wield two-handed
weapons
 * Broadened the food sense ability to cover more types of food
 * Hobbits are now stealthy
 * Tweaked starting inventories for characters so that Hobbits don't
start with regular body armor, and are less burdened
 * Created a "hobbit long sword", which is smilar to a short sword,
but is slashing and uses the long sword skill (for Hobbit knights).

